{ci: Solo Verse 1}
[B]      [E]   [B/D#]                 [F#/A#]       [B]
Lord, I love You	You are my present help
[B/D#]        [E]     [B/D#]	  [C#/E# - D#m - C#]      		[F#/A# - G#m - F#]
You knew my every move        	before my    first     step
[B/D#]        [E]          [B/D#]	[Gdim]	[G#m - Eb/G - G#m]
You hold the world in Your hands, both land and sea
[E]   [B/D#]                [Gdim] [G#m - Eb/G - G#m]
For You are mighty, 	        You are mighty
{ci: Solo Verse 2}
[B]     [E]	     [B/D#]	    [F#/A#]	 [B]
The sun, moon, and the stars, they bow down at Your name
[B/D#]	[E]     [B/D#]  	[C#/E# - D#m - C#]       	  [B]   [F#/A# - G#m - F#]
Your arms consume me like  	shelter from            the rain
[B/D#]        [E]           [B/D#]       [Gdim]	[G#m- Eb/G - G#m]
You shed your blood and You died to save humanity
[E]   [B/D#] 	[Gdim][G#m]
For You are mighty, You are mighty
[E]   [B/D#]	    [F#/A#] [B]
Mighty, for You are mighty
{ci: Chorus}
[G#m7] [F#]    [D#m7][C#m7]
Mighty, 	mighty
{ci: Verse}
[E]	[Gdim]	  [G#m7]	         [F#/A# - B - B/D#]
Powerful,     merciful,    holy,  Youre      mighty
[E]	[Gdim]	  [G#m7]
Powerful,     merciful,  holy,  Youre	mighty
{ci: Repeat Chorus and Verse}
{ci: Bridge}
[E]	[Gdim]	    [G#m7]	      [Cdim]    [C#m7] [B]    [E]
Powerful,    	merciful,	  for all power is in Your hands
[E]	[Gdim]	    [G#m7]	      [Cdim]    [C#m7] [B]    [A9]
Powerful,    	merciful, 	for all power is in Your hands
{ci: Repeat Chorus}
Vamp 1& 2  (same chords as Chorus)
Mighty are You...
Holy are You...
Worthy are You...
Awesome are You...
